Your mission is to design, develop, integrate, test, and deliver a **fully playable, realistic, third-person, open-world action-adventure game with the systemic depth, freedom, cinematic presentation, driving mechanics, and emergent gameplay associated with Grand Theft Auto V**.

This game must be an original intellectual property. Do not copy Rockstar Games' proprietary source code, map geometry, recognizable characters, dialogue, missions, music, logos, or copyrighted artwork.

